{"speciesId":817,"names":{"fr":"Arrozard","es":"Drizzile","en":"Drizzile","ja":"ジメレオン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il crée des bombes à eau grâce au liquide qu’il sécrète avec la paume de ses mains. Il s’en sert dans les combats où la stratégie prime."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Crea bolas de agua con el líquido que segrega por las palmas de las manos y las usa en combate de forma estratégica."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"A clever combatant, this Pokémon battles using water balloons created with moisture secreted from its palms."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"手のひらから 出る 水分を 丸めて つくった 水の 玉を 使い 頭脳戦を 繰り広げる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Paresseux, mais malin, il parsème son territoire de pièges pour empêcher ses ennemis d’y pénétrer."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es inteligente, pero no muestra especial interés por nada. Distribuye trampas por su territorio para mantener alejados a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Highly intelligent but also very lazy, it keeps enemies out of its territory by laying traps everywhere."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"頭が よく 面倒くさがり。 縄張りに 敵が 近づかないよう そこかしこに 罠を 仕掛けている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":817,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"haze","learns":[[25,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"